1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,200
Online fashion shopping has made beautiful ethnic wear accessible to everyone.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:11,800
But one question still creates uncertainty: will the outfit actually fit?

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:18,000
Priya finds a beautiful kurta, selects size M, and places her order.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,900
But when it arrives, the fit is uncomfortable. The shoulders and bust are too tight.

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,500
She requests a return.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,800
For Priya, this is a disappointing experience.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:39,500
For the business, it means additional shipping costs, reverse logistics, and inventory handling.

8
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:44,500
Traditional customer service reacts after the problem happens.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Meet FitBack-AI: an intelligent agent designed to prevent, recover, and learn from returns.

10
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:58,000
Before purchase, FitBack-AI understands customer fit preferences and retrieves product size charts.

11
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:04,500
It compares available measurements and provides an explainable recommendation.

12
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,800
The customer remains completely free to choose another size.

13
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:15,500
If a fit problem occurs, FitBack-AI helps recover the customer experience.

14
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:21,500
It checks the order, verifies policy, checks inventory, and offers an eligible exchange.

15
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:27,500
With the customer's permission, it initiates the appropriate workflow.

16
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,800
The objective is to retain the sale while strictly respecting customer choice.

17
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:40,500
Finally, FitBack-AI learns from every return, preparing insights for the quality team.

18
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:50,500
FitBack-AI uses Retrieval-Augmented Generation, also known as RAG.

19
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:57,500
RAG allows the agent to search the brand's own documents before generating an answer.

20
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:04,500
These include product catalogues, size charts, fabric guides, and return policies.

21
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,500
When Priya asks which size to choose, the agent retrieves grounded product data.

22
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:17,500
This significantly reduces reliance on unsupported AI guesses.

23
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:24,500
Through MCP, the agent connects directly with enterprise business systems.

24
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:31,000
It checks orders, queries warehouse inventory, and initiates permitted workflows.

25
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:37,500
This is what makes it an actionable AI agent rather than simply a chatbot.

26
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:50,500
But AI systems are not perfect.

27
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:57,500
While analysing return records, the agent identifies upper-body fit complaints.

28
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:04,000
However, it makes an incorrect assumption about flat garment measurements.

29
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:10,500
A human quality manager reviews the underlying data and catches the mistake.

30
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:16,500
The proposed change is rejected and prevented from publishing to production.

31
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:22,800
FitBack-AI supports human decisions. It does not replace human accountability.

32
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:28,500
AI assists. Humans remain in control.

33
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:36,500
With FitBack-AI, customers make informed size decisions with greater confidence.

34
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:42,500
Consider an illustrative scenario with 1,000 monthly orders and 100 size returns.

35
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:49,500
If 30 returns are prevented at ₹250 per return, the business saves ₹7,500.

36
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:57,000
If 20 exchanges retain orders at ₹1,500 AOV, that represents ₹30,000 gross order value retained.

37
00:03:57,500 --> 00:04:03,500
These figures are illustrative estimates, not measured historical results.

38
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:10,000
The real power is continuous learning: Prevent the wrong fit, Recover the sale, and Learn from every return.

39
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:25,000
FitBack-AI: PREVENT. RECOVER. LEARN.
Group 4 — Customer Service | College AI Studio Showcase

40
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:40,000
Production Tools: Antigravity IDE, Microsoft Edge Neural TTS, React 19, Recharts, FFmpeg.
All customer data and measurements are fictional.
